# The search is for mana value 1 plus the sacrificed enchantment's own: sacrificing Sylvan Library (mana value 2, cast before
# Enigmatic Incarnation, whose own is 4) finds a Gray Ogre (3), and neither a Llanowar Elves (1) nor a Grizzly Bears (2)
# (CR 608.2c, 701.21a, 202.3, 400.7).
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald x3
Enigmatic Incarnation
Sylvan Library
Fang of Shigeki
Gray Ogre
Llanowar Elves
Grizzly Bears
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#1.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sylvan Library.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#3.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Enigmatic Incarnation.Cast
[T1 Bot1.End]
Bot1.Choose(Sylvan Library)
! Bot1.Search(Llanowar Elves)
! Bot1.Search(Grizzly Bears)
Bot1.Search(Gray Ogre)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Gray Ogre.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves = (absent)
Bot1.Graveyard = Sylvan Library; Black Lotus
